# Schlep-engine AI-powered data analysis platform - Commit Message Template
# 
# Format: <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Type:
# feat:     New feature
# fix:      Bug fix
# docs:     Documentation changes
# style:    Code style changes (formatting, etc)
# refactor: Code refactoring
# test:     Adding or updating tests
# chore:    Maintenance tasks
# perf:     Performance improvements
# ci:       CI/CD changes
# build:    Build system changes
#
# Scope (optional):
# frontend, backend, api, ui, ml, docs, config
#
# Examples:
# feat(ml): add automated data labeling with confidence scoring
# fix(api): resolve CORS issue in upload endpoint
# docs: update README with new installation instructions
# refactor(frontend): extract data visualization logic to custom hooks
#
# Body (optional): Explain what and why, not how
# 
# Footer (optional): Reference issues and breaking changes
# Closes #123
# BREAKING CHANGE: API endpoint /v1/analyze now requires authentication 